WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:28.588
Mrs. Tiggywinkle saw some potato soup.

2
00:00:28.589 --> 00:00:30.832
She put it on the table.

3
00:00:30.833 --> 00:00:33.991
"Cousin, eat this soup," she said.

4
00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:36.179
"You must get well."

5
00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.764
"That is Simpkin's lunch," the tailor said.

6
00:00:39.765 --> 00:00:41.809
"He is my friend.

7
00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:49.161
He went to buy buttons for this coat."

8
00:00:49.162 --> 00:00:53.004
"Simpkin will not mind," Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

9
00:00:53.005 --> 00:01:09.046
"Please. You must eat."

10
00:01:09.047 --> 00:01:21.885
The tailor ate the soup.

11
00:01:21.886 --> 00:01:24.604
Soon Simpkin came back.

12
00:01:24.605 --> 00:01:26.942
He rubbed his belly.

13
00:01:26.943 --> 00:01:29.897
"It's time for lunch," he said.

14
00:01:29.898 --> 00:01:39.360
"And I am very hungry."

15
00:01:39.361 --> 00:01:42.972
Then Simpkin spotted the empty pot.

16
00:01:42.973 --> 00:01:46.208
"My lunch!" he cried.

17
00:01:46.209 --> 00:01:56.303
"I will make more potato soup," Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

18
00:01:56.304 --> 00:02:01.457
She looked around.

19
00:02:01.458 --> 00:02:08.253
But there were no more potatoes.

20
00:02:08.254 --> 00:02:11.634
"Simpkin." The tailor stood up.

21
00:02:11.635 --> 00:02:13.970
"Where are the buttons?"

22
00:02:13.971 --> 00:02:16.184
Simpkin frowned.

23
00:02:16.185 --> 00:02:20.090
"The shop was closed," he said.

24
00:02:20.091 --> 00:02:24.309
Simpkin stomped over to the fire.

25
00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:27.934
"So we have no buttons!" he said.

26
00:02:27.935 --> 00:02:32.754
He folded his arms and sat down.

27
00:02:32.755 --> 00:02:38.665
"Oh no." The tailor sank into the chair.

28
00:02:38.666 --> 00:02:40.873
"This is terrible.

29
00:02:40.874 --> 00:02:49.831
The mayor's coat must have buttons!"
